ote=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a11ac7fb28e6200\" href=\"?note=9a11ac7fb28e6200\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equational-class\">93-df-quasi-equational-class</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"thm-quasivariety-theorem-thm-quasivariety-theorem","text":"thm-quasivariety-theorem `thm-quasivariety-theorem`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasivariety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}$, and $\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}$ have the exact signatures fixed in [[93-df-quasivariety]] and [[93-df-quasi-equational-class]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasi-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"9a11ac7fb28e6200","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"